Hi Wu Jin,
as Antigoni said you can use subst function to extract desired number of characters from a string:

tpsFilePath <- "xyz" [change xyz with the path of your tps file]

require (geomorph)

tpsFile <- readland.tps (tpsFilePath, specID = "imageID")

idsAll <- dimnames(tpsFile)[[3]]

idsFour <- substr (idsAll, 1, 4) # arguments 1 and 4 define the range of characters to be extracted from the string

print (idsFour)

Best,
Marko

